					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Mammoth on December 24, 2006, 12:49:12 am</div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: temsweety on December 22, 2006, 08:59:07 pm</div><div class="quote">since when has the news <i><b>ever</b></i> been reliable??<br /><br />besides, if not very many people know about it in the first place, then there won&#039;t be very many people that will realize how crap it is and want to change it<br /></div><br />Ha, guess you were wrong.<br /></div><br /><br />it&#039;s not about being right or wrong. let&#039;s not be petty. if this shit goes through, <i>everybody</i> looses. Plus, battle&#039;s not over yet, only just begun...</div>
